OL,3,GNEWSADisabled woman had to 'crawl on
OL,4,Ahands and knees' to get off train
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wheelchair user was left in tears as
OL,7,Fshe crawled on her "hands and knees"
OL,8,Fthrough a train after being told a ramp
OL,9,Fcould not be used to help her off.
OL,11,FPhoebe Tesoriere, 24, was on a Great
OL,12,FWestern Railway (GWR) train from London
OL,13,FPaddington to Bath Spa with her parents
OL,14,Fwhen it happened.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
