OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.,%%**,$-,(,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSADisabled woman had to 'crawl on
OL,4,Ahands and knees' to get off train
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer family spoke to the assistance desk
OL,7,Fand were taken to the only designated
OL,8,Fwheelchair space on the train. Phoebe
OL,9,Fsaid she was assured a ramp and
OL,10,Fassistance would be waiting, but on
OL,11,Farrival was told she was in a carriage
OL,12,Fbeyond the platform, leaving her unable
OL,13,Fto get off.
OL,15,FGWR said it was "really sorry" and
OL,16,Fadmitted "we let her down, both when we
OL,17,Fhelped her board and at several points
OL,18,Fduring her journey".
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
